  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "ひょうせつちたいを　かいゆうする。きょうじんな　きんにくとぶあつい　ひかしぼうで　からだを　まもる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "빙설 지대를 떼 지어 다닌다. 강인한 근육과 두꺼운 피하지방으로 몸을 보호한다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "迴游在冰雪地帶的寶可夢。會用強韌的肌肉和厚實的皮下脂肪保護自己的身體。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ce Pokémon arpente les étendues de neige et de glace. Ses muscles puissants et son épaisse couche de graisse protègent son corps.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wandert in eisigen Schneegebieten umher. Mit den starken Muskeln und der dicken Fettschicht unter seiner Haut schützt es seinen Körper.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon vive en áreas cubiertas de nieve y hielo. Se protege con su fuerte musculatura y una gruesa capa de grasa subcutánea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si aggira per le regioni più fredde. Il suo corpo è protetto da poderosi muscoli e da uno spesso strato di grasso sottocutaneo.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "This Pokémon wanders around snowy, icy areas. It protects its body with powerful muscles and a thick layer of fat under its skin.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "氷雪地帯を　回遊する。強靭な　筋肉とぶ厚い　皮下脂肪で　体を　守る。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "会在冰雪地带回游。以强韧的肌肉和厚实的皮下脂肪来保护身体。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Este Pokémon vive en áreas cubiertas de nieve y hielo. Se protege con su fuerte musculatura y una gruesa capa de grasa subcutánea.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "scarlet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/40/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "こおりエネルギーの　しゅうちゅうするうわあごの　ツノが　！\u0003\u0007超低温ちょうていおん超低温になってしゅういを　こおらせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "얼음 에너지를 집중시키면 위턱의 뿔이 초저온이 되어 주위를 얼려 버린다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "會集中冰能量使上顎的角變得超低溫，然後將自己附近的一切都凍成冰塊。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il emmagasine de l’énergie de type Glace dans la corne de sa mâchoire, qui est si froide qu’elle gèle tout ce qui se trouve alentour.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Im Horn seines Oberkiefers speichert es Eis-Energie, wodurch dieses eisige Temperaturen annimmt und sein Umfeld einfriert.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Acumula energía gélida en el cuerno del maxilar superior, que llega a alcanzar temperaturas muy bajas y congelar sus alrededores.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Concentra l’energia Ghiaccio nel corno sulla mascella superiore, portandolo a temperature talmente basse da congelare ciò che ha intorno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ice energy builds up in the horn on its upper jaw, causing the horn to reach cryogenic temperatures that freeze its surroundings.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "氷エネルギーの　集中する上あごの　ツノが　！\u0003\u0007超低温ちょうていおん超低温になって周囲を　凍らせる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "violet",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/41/"
